		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Charred, crispy body that moves though dead. Smoke drifts from its empty eyes. Malevolent, loathes sunlight.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 31, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +6 (1d8) or death gaze, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Death Gaze</strong>. One target the bodak can see within near, CON 15+ or 3d6 CHA damage. Dies at 0 CHA, rises as a bodak at midnight.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fears the Sun</strong>. Fears sunlight. Takes 2d6 damage each round in direct sunlight.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
